    "id": "art-7",
    "articleNo": "ART-007",
    "titleZh": "提示词设计的产品思维：让AI系统真正理解用户需求",
    "titleEn": "Prompt Design Product Thinking: Enabling AI Systems to Truly Understand User Needs",
    "summaryZh": "深入探讨提示词设计的产品思维，如何让AI系统真正理解用户需求",
    "summaryEn": "Deep dive into product thinking for prompt design, how to enable AI systems to truly understand user needs",
    "contentZh": "<h3 style=\"margin: 28px 0px 14px; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; color: rgb(241, 245, 249); letter-spacing: 0.02em; border-bottom: 2px solid rgb(71, 85, 105); padding-bottom: 8px;\">提示词设计的产品思维：让AI系统真正理解用户需求</h3><div style=\"margin: 16px 0px;\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Hale-Song/AIpmbull/main/public/assets/images/img-mucc87j8-e35f.jpeg\" alt=\"提示词设计产品思维封面\" style=\"max-width: 100%; border-radius: 8px; display: block;\"></div><p style=\"line-height: 1.8; color: rgb(226, 232, 240); text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 12px; font-size: 15px;\"><em style=\"font-style:italic;\">图：提示词设计的产品思维核心主题</em></p><h3 style=\"margin: 22px 0px 12px; font-size: 19px; font-weight: 700; color: rgb(241, 245, 249); letter-spacing: 0.02em; border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(51, 65, 85); padding-bottom: 8px;\">一、为什么提示词是AI产品的核心能力</h3><p style=\"line-height: 1.8; color: rgb(226, 232, 240); text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 12px; font-size: 15px;\">当用户输入\"我需要一条参加婚礼的裙子\"时，普通AI可能会回复\"你可以上京东/亚马逊/淘宝买一件\"，这种无效回答的核心问题在于：</p><ul style=\"margin: 8px 0px; padding-left: 24px; line-height: 1.8; color: rgb(226, 232, 240); list-style-type: disc;\"><li style=\"margin-bottom: 4px; font-size: 15px;\"><strong style=\"font-weight:700;color:#f1f5f9;\">用户模糊诉求=高风险</strong>：需求不明确导致推荐不准确，严重影响用户体验</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 4px; font-size: 15px;\"><strong style=\"font-weight:700;color:#f1f5f9;\">商品缺乏条件=难匹配</strong>：缺乏具体筛选条件，难以从海量商品中精准匹配</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 4px; font-size: 15px;\"><strong style=\"font-weight:700;color:#f1f5f9;\">需可执行输入</strong>：AI无法直接将模糊需求转化为可操作的指令</li></ul><p style=\"line-height: 1.8; color: rgb(226, 232, 240); text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 12px; font-size: 15px;\">提示词设计的核心价值，就是将用户模",
    "contentEn": "",
